  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Non-Comedogenic</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Medium Coverage</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Good for: Dark Circles</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Radiant Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean at Sephora</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is</strong>: A creamy, clean, non-comedogenic, skincare-packed concealer that’s safe for sensitive skin with medium coverage and a fresh, hydrated, radiant finish.</p><p><br></p><p ><strong>Coverage:</strong> Medium</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Finish:</strong> Radiant</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Formulation:</strong> Cream</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Skin Type:</strong> Normal, Dry, Combination, and Oily</p><p><br></p><p ><strong>Highlighted Ingredients: </strong></p><p>- Caffeine and Pink Algae Extract: Fights dark circles, puffiness, and dullness.</p><p>- Hyaluronic Acid and Peptides: Hydrate and visibly plump for supple, juicy skin.</p><p>- Arnica and Panthenol: The ultimate skin-calming tool for blemishes and redness.</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><p><strong>Suggested Usage:</strong></p><p >-Apply anywhere you want to visibly brighten, conceal, or smooth—under eyes, blemishes, or cheekbones. You literally can’t mess it up.</p><p>-Swipe or dab the doe-foot applicator over skin, then blend using your fingers, a brush, or a sponge.</p><p>-Perfect for spot coverage or layering over foundation.</p></div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-Caffeine and Pink Algae Extract: Fights dark circles, puffiness, and dullness.<br>-Hyaluronic Acid and Peptides: Hydrate and visibly plump for supple, juicy skin. <br>-Arnica and Panthenol: The ultimate skin-calming tool for blemishes and redness.<br><br>Aqua/Water/Eau, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Mica, Octyldodecanol, Polyglyceryl-2 Dipolyhydroxystearate, Ethylhexyl Olivate, Undecane, Glycerin, Polyhydroxystearic Acid, Polyglyceryl-3 Diisostearate, Galactoarabinan, Helianthus Annuus (Sunflower) Seed Cera (Wax), Tridecane, Propanediol, Lecithin, Glyceryl Oleate, Pentylene Glycol, Panthenol, Sodium Hyaluronate, Palmitoyl Tripeptide-5, Caffeine, Squalane, Dunaliella Salina (Algae) Extract, Tocopherol, Maltodextrin, Arnica Montana (Arnica) Flower Extract, Helianthus Annuus (Sunflower) Seed Oil, Rosmarinus Officinalis (Rosemary) Leaf Oil, Foeniculum Vulgare (Fennel) Fruit Oil,  Potassium Sorbate, Sodium Benzoate, Glycine Soja (Soybean) Oil, Phenethyl Alcohol, Ascorbyl Palmitate, Hydrogenated Palm Glycerides Citrate, Phytosterols  [May Contain: Titanium Dioxide (CI 77891), Iron Oxides (CI 77491), Iron Oxides (CI 77492), Iron Oxides (CI 77499)]<br><br><br><br><i>The list of ingredients is subject to change, please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</i></div></details>",
